  "job_B15.8.152_20260920_210325": {
    "text": "\u00deis syndon \u00fea lang meare to Curi \u00fee ad\u00feelstan Kyng gef criste to lofe and sancte Petre.\nIn to Muchelnie for hys yldrena sawla & for hys sawla & for ealra \u00feara Kyngena \u00fee after hym were \u00feat\nOn a\u00felongabig, of athlangabig on \u00feene lypston.\nOf \u00fean lypstane on \u00fea stankestlas ant swa \u00feanne on spedeway.\nOf spedewege on bulestan, of bulanstane on ilestream.\nOf ilestreame on \u00fea Haran apoldran, & swa \u00feanon of \u00feaere Haran apoldran on \u00feone docc \u00feyfel.\nOf \u00feam docc \u00feyfele on pedan maede & swa andlang more on hrocabeara.\nOf hrocabeara on \u00feone pol, of \u00feam pole ou eastheal.\nOf eastheale on \u00fea my\u00fea, of \u00feam my\u00feum on horsies land pyll.\nOf horsies land pylle, eft on pederidan.",
